     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\">Hi Alexandre,<div><br></div><div>Thanks for reaching out. Just wanted to add here that we are currently finishing up development of MaAsLin2 and looking at a possibility of adding phyloseq compatibility for the users. We will email the MaAsLin Google group once we have the release ready (hopefully very soon). In the meantime, please free to let me or Lauren know if you have any questions.</div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks,</div><div>Himel </div></div>"
    ],
